40
00:02:05.695 --> 00:02:15.354
We visit the zoo. The penguin waddles and the kangaroo hops. The panda eats bamboo, and the pink flamingo stands on one leg.

41
00:02:15.404 --> 00:02:18.232
I love this story, Ms. Lily!

42
00:02:19.561 --> 00:02:24.904
What is it? Can you say it?

43
00:02:24.954 --> 00:02:27.280
Penguin! Well done!

44
00:02:28.452 --> 00:02:34.189
What is it? Can you say it?

45
00:02:34.239 --> 00:02:36.878
Flamingo! Well done!

46
00:02:37.946 --> 00:02:43.625
What is it? Can you say it?

47
00:02:43.675 --> 00:02:46.071
Koala! Well done!

48
00:02:47.197 --> 00:02:49.072
Let's say it together!

49
00:02:49.122 --> 00:02:53.014
The kangaroo can hop. The penguin can swim.

50
00:02:53.064 --> 00:02:57.697
Your turn!

51
00:02:57.747 --> 00:03:01.471
The kangaroo can hop. The penguin can swim.

52
00:03:02.431 --> 00:03:07.955
